error[SC0409]: this reads `q`, which another argument of the same call writes
   ╭─[ a_write_through_a_pointer_another_argument_writes_is_reported.c:5:16 ]
   │
 5 │     h(q = &x, *q = 1);
   │       ───┬──   ┬  
   │          ╰──────── written here
   │                │  
   │                ╰── read here
───╯
  = note: C17 6.5 p2 makes this call undefined: 6.5.2.2 p10 orders a call's arguments before the call and not against each other
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = help: assign it in a statement of its own before the call
